# Optional. The API also reads the repo-root .env (see ../.env.example and docs/MODELS.md).
# Names and purpose only — no secrets belong in this example.
# MODAL_* is not read.

# --- Models (text and vision are separate; set one text key) ---
# MODEL_API_KEY        Meta Model API key. Muse Spark 1.3 for text only.
# META_API_KEY         Alias of MODEL_API_KEY. Wins if both Meta keys are set.
# BASETEN_API_KEY      Text when no Meta key is set. Also the default vision key.
# BASETEN_MODEL        Text model id on the Baseten path. Default meta-models/muse-spark-open-1026.
#                      A DeepSeek id here is refused and does not change vision.
# META_PROVIDER        meta, or baseten when the Baseten key is the text host.
# META_BASE_URL        Default https://api.meta.ai/v1, or Baseten's URL on the text path.
# META_MODEL           Default muse-spark-1.3, or BASETEN_MODEL on the text Baseten path.
# META_REASONING_EFFORT  Default low. Sent only to the Meta Model API.
# VISION_MODEL         Draw-CAPTCHA model. Default deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017.
# VISION_BASE_URL      Vision host. Default https://inference.baseten.co/v1.
# VISION_API_KEY       Vision key. Defaults to BASETEN_API_KEY (Meta key if the vision host is api.meta.ai).
# VISION_PROVIDER      Optional label. Inferred from the host. "meta" is ignored for a non-Meta model.
# META_VISION_API_KEY  Legacy vision key. Used only when VISION_API_KEY is unset.
# META_VISION_PROVIDER Legacy vision provider. Used only when VISION_PROVIDER is unset.
# META_VISION_BASE_URL Legacy vision base URL. Used only when VISION_BASE_URL is unset.
# META_VISION_MODEL    Legacy vision model id. Used only when VISION_MODEL is unset.
# META_TIMEOUT_SECONDS Text call budget in seconds. Default 8. Clamped to 0.2–60.
# META_VISION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS  Vision budget. Default 15. Used when VISION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS is unset.
# VISION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS       Optional vision budget. Wins over META_VISION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS.
# META_MAX_RETRIES     Extra attempts after the first. Default 1, capped at 2.
#                      Read timeouts are not retried. Connection errors and
#                      HTTP 408/429/500/502/503/504 are. Applies to text and vision.

# --- Process ---
# HOST                 Interface for `python app.py`. Default 127.0.0.1, or 0.0.0.0 when PORT is set.
# PORT                 Port for `python app.py`. Default 8787.
# FLASK_DEBUG          1/0. Also accepts DEBUG. Default 1 locally, 0 when PORT or AURIF_ENV=production.
# AURIF_ENV            Set to production to force the debugger off.
# AURIF_API_PUBLIC_URL Public API origin (alias: API_BASE). Default http://127.0.0.1:$PORT.
# CUSTOMER_SITE_URL    Storefront origin (alias: STOREFRONT_URL). Default http://127.0.0.1:5173.
# DASHBOARD_URL        Owner dashboard origin. Default http://127.0.0.1:5174.
# AURIF_CORS_ORIGINS   Comma-separated extra origins (alias: CORS_ORIGINS). "*" is ignored.
# AURIF_SITE_KEY       Demo site key applied only when store.json is first created.
# AURIF_STORE_PATH     store.json location. Default server/data/store.json.
